sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Frontend (React)
    participant Auth as Auth Route (/api/auth)
    participant JWT as JWT Middleware
    participant Protect as Protected Route (/api/profile)

    Note over Client,Auth: Phase 1: Login Request (Issuing Token)
    Client->>Auth: POST /login { email, password }
    Auth->>Auth: Validate Bcrypt Hash from DB
    Auth->>JWT: Request Token (payload: userId, role)
    JWT-->>Auth: Signed JWT Token ('eyJhbGci...')
    Auth-->>Client: 200 OK + JSON Token

    Note over Client,Protect: Phase 2: Protected Route Access
    Client->>Protect: GET /profile (Header: Authorization Bearer)
    Protect->>JWT: Intercept & Verify Token Signature
    alt Token Invalid / Expired
        JWT-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized Response
    else Token Valid
        JWT-->>Protect: Token Valid (Decoded User Object)
        Protect-->>Client: 200 OK (Protected DB Data)
    end
